    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257270/extras/315e7844a3787d06bf80f3326d208ef6.avif?t=1748382459\" width=569 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257270/extras/4985cd6c74afad5371b9ec72fb20ad75.avif?t=1748382459\" width=569 height=352 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Haunted by Femboy, you unexpectedly inherit a mysterious mansion from your estranged father. While exploring your new home, you discover an ancient cursed book called the &quot;Bussy-Nomicon&quot; and accidentally summon Quinn - a flirtatious ghost femboy who's been trapped in the book for a millennium. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now bound together for life, can you uncover the secrets of your father's mansion while dealing with your spooky new companion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3257270/extras/5f5cf06fffbb720d33b1c6b8b7bf86ce.avif?t=1748382459\" width=568 height=217 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You can expect:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on decisions and choices made throughout the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two romanceable love-interests: Quinn and Laverne.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English Voice Acting for all major story scenes and events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectibles and mini-games that unlock new scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animated CGs for most spicy scenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Translations for 